@startuml
title 数据备份系统部署图
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName PingFang SC
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam BorderColor #64748B
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam roundcorner 8
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam componentBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam componentBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
skinparam databaseBorderColor #64748B
package "macOS 工作站" {
  component "桌面应用" as DesktopApp <<process>>
  component "CLI" as CLIProcess <<process>>
  component "后台守护进程" as DaemonProcess <<process>>
  component "备份核心" as CoreLibrary <<library>>
  database "SQLite 元数据文件" as SQLiteFile <<file>>
  folder "口令保护的文本密钥文件" as KeyFile <<versioned JSON>>
}
package "本地存储设施" {
  folder "源数据卷" as SourceVolume <<APFS / mounted volume>>
  folder "本地备份卷" as BackupVolume <<repository>>
}
package "远程存储设施" {
  cloud "WebDAV 服务" as WebDAV <<HTTPS>>
  cloud "S3 兼容服务" as S3 <<HTTPS>>
}
DesktopApp --> DaemonProcess : 本地版本化接口
CLIProcess --> DaemonProcess : 本地版本化接口
DaemonProcess --> CoreLibrary : 进程内调用
DaemonProcess --> SQLiteFile : 事务读写
CoreLibrary --> KeyFile : 按需解锁
CoreLibrary --> SourceVolume : 只读扫描
CoreLibrary --> BackupVolume : 仓库协议
CoreLibrary --> WebDAV : HTTPS / WebDAV
CoreLibrary --> S3 : HTTPS / S3 API
@enduml
